This project is a Gold Quant Analytics Pipeline.
It downloads real gold futures data from Yahoo Finance, adds a synthetic sentiment factor,
measures sentiment sensitivity through regression, forecasts short-term markout prices, 
runs Monte Carlo simulations for 30-day projections, calculates risk metrics such as VaR,
 Expected Shortfall and Sharpe Ratio, monitors X-Y-Z pipeline latency, and visualizes the 
results in a five-panel interactive dashboard.

This project will show: 

Yahoo ticker
Yahoo Finance link
Rows loaded
Project description
Pipeline timestamps
Latency
Sentiment beta
Correlation
Monte Carlo result
Risk metrics  
These are Python built-in libraries:  json, time, urllib.
time              : measure latency
json              : read Yahoo Finance API response
urllib.request    : download Yahoo Finance data
dataclass         : create configuration class
date/datetime     : handle dates
Dict, Tuple       :type hints
ticker = "GC=F"  means Gold Futures.

